    "detailed_description": "Movefort is a survival tower defense roguelike game. In this world where monsters grow stronger over time, you need to build various towers on a moving platform, collect coins to enhance yourself and your towers, and strive to survive.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2>1. Each tower can be upgraded independently.<br>2. You can bring coins into each game, so you don\u2019t have to start from scratch.<br>3. You can pause at any time to adjust the tower .<br>4. Break records in INFINITE Mode and find the best tower combinations.<br>5. Upgrade platform levels and slots  to increase the number of towers.",
